dsh-mobile-ui README · Usage：Once installed and loaded, open the DSH Web GUI. The plugin activates automatically when the viewport is ≤ 768 px wide. Resize your browser or use Chrome DevTools device mode to test.

Other plugins can subscribe to viewport changes:

```typescript
ctx.on('mobile-viewport/change', (state) => {
  if (state.size === 'compact') {
    // Adapt your UI for small screens
  }
